# Shared skill storage

Use task-observer at session start and run its Session Start Protocol before the first tool call. Its stable user workspace is `{{ .chezmoi.homeDir }}/.local/state/agent-observer`. The observation log is `{{ .chezmoi.homeDir }}/.local/state/agent-observer/skill-observations/observation-log/`; skill updates are staged under `{{ .chezmoi.homeDir }}/.local/state/agent-observer/skill-updates/`. Use these paths across projects and agents. Subagents report observations to their controller.

For Rust changes, use the installed ms-rust skill before editing Rust files.

For browser work through chrome-devtools-axi, run `eval "$(axi-chrome start)"`, then `chrome-devtools-axi pages` and `selectpage <id>` before opening a URL. The helper uses the installed Playwright Chromium and stores its own profile under the standard local data directory.
